{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/060cc4ec7650b2b609f943fa24b894be.webp?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/8e6e6f415dcdc18a9e9ed245cb5a5292.poster.avif?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/8e6e6f415dcdc18a9e9ed245cb5a5292.webm?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/8e6e6f415dcdc18a9e9ed245cb5a5292.mp4?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Your ball drops like a brick through colorful helix platforms that block its descent, but if you hit a red spot, it's over! Your ball shatters to pieces and you have to start your fall all over again.</strong><br><br>Even traps platforms are no match for a fireball falling at full speed! Choose your strategy: speed up like a madman or stop and wait for your next chance to roll and jump!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/487063b4c00c4ed19d41dd2e85094bb5.webp?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/dc5862fa5a21315dac6d34a9f2a40e6d.poster.avif?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/dc5862fa5a21315dac6d34a9f2a40e6d.webm?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/dc5862fa5a21315dac6d34a9f2a40e6d.mp4?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you don't want to play solo, choose a multiplayer mode for up to 4 players and compete with your friends or family. Together, pick one of the three different gameplay modes with special challenges: get the highest score while avoiding getting minus points, be the first at the finish line, or go as far as you can in a limited time! Reveal who is the fastest and most agile jumping ball among you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/460f1500976b95649a7599c138b9b26d.webp?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/d363596deb107b3fa8028eed9b50324f.poster.avif?t=1757699107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/d363596deb107b3fa8028eed9b50324f.webm?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751330/extras/d363596deb107b3fa8028eed9b50324f.mp4?t=1757699107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The key is mastering your reflexes and looking ahead. To guide the bouncing ball, rotate the platforms to align the ball with the cracks. Do this in quick succession for a combo move and higher points. If you pass 3 levels consecutively, you'll be invincible for the first bounce after!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>drop your ball with crazy fast speed and make your way through helix platforms<br></li><li>face your friends or family in multiplayer mode for up to 4 players with 3 different gameplay modes!<br></li><li>practice your reflexes and break your best scores<br></li><li>see how many levels you can complete in this never-ending game<br></li><li>defeat bosses on levels with obstacles like switches and metal platforms that not even a fireball falling at full speed can destroy<br></li><li>customize your ball with variety of funny skins<br></li><li>invite anyone to play thanks to easy controls and simple rules<br></li><li>never get bored thanks to this amazing time killer!</li></ul><br>Jump into never ending adventure with unlimited levels, test your skills and invite others to have fun together!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Not bad!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/8599b26a8bb282f5bea1bd3ce5f1d10b551420f3.jpg"},{"name":"That's a lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/613f7a77859b1beef899c5812a12404f9efe5b68.jpg"},{"name":"I'm on top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/85031f1440131b39bb82a32949c536b97c9e94fc.jpg"},{"name":"It's only beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/ed54bdf29e251b34decbcef953b0ebe1043fa7a5.jpg"},{"name":"Quite far","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/2cf74a330b9f83757da5d7f99f6aca13017ee09d.jpg"},{"name":"It's been a long way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/062b9e7d4e5b510cb073cfaaf5ce2d65c3e99efc.jpg"},{"name":"I'm back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/de6763253e5d237b5258ebce51a5fdb32c599198.jpg"},{"name":"Not my day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/9b30fef8507e5ad114d60db42724f9d493e81195.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2751330/47ac17713b0ebdd2ed395b3992f03f1ef656491f.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion icon","path":"https://cdn.akam